@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB

WB has ReceiveDat,LowPower,Idle

WB is Idle

@WB
0 is ReceiveDat
+100 is LowPower
+100 is Idle
+100 is LowPower
+100 is Idle
+100 is LowPower
+100 is ReceiveDat
+100 is LowPower
+100 is Idle
WB@0 <-> @100 : {51 ms}
WB@300 <-> @400 : {52 ms}
WB@500 <-> @+300 : {53 ms}
@enduml